## SEVERITY / VERDICT
*Blocker:* a path beyond the two or any byte of the product, a fixture or a golden; ANY minus line, or an existing line, helper, constant or assertion edited; a skip, removal, weakening or disabling; a sent text that holds no refused character (a refusal for the wrong reason); an edge character that is not an ASCII space; **any of W4s, W4e, Wm4s, Wm4e surviving every new case (B492-1 not closed)**; any round-1 mutant (A1, A2, A3a, A3b, A4, A6) surviving every row; a new case green at main alone's product and red at the head's own, or the class or the mock file red merged and green at main alone; a lost or renamed test name, or an added name that is not one of the 16; the Api project or the web suite red merged and green at main alone; a build warning or error; a merge conflict; overlap > 0 with a live lane that conflicts or shares a path; a request leaving loopback; a secret; the head moved. *Major:* a NEW half-trim variant of yours (X1-X3, Xm1) that WIDENS the allowance within property P and survives every new row AND is reachable as stated in Check 2(c); a builder claim your measurement contradicts (82 / 105, 23 / 15, the kill counts, the whole-suite figures, 5/5); a process, port or lock left; load discipline broken without figures. *Minor/Note (never a NO GO alone):* a kill by a different case than the builder named; the unmasked `UatOpenAssertionTests` drift if present; a variant that survives only because it is equivalent or unreachable (say why); round 1's Notes B492-2..7 still open. **Round 2 of 2: overall GO / GO WITH FINDINGS / NO GO; a NO GO is the cap: state the fix-shape in prose and say that Tuesday cards the product owner.** **First line of STATUS:** `GATE VERDICT B494: b490 <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> @ 6708ac6 (round 2 of 2 · delta <2 paths, 1 commit, +23 +15 -0 by program y/n, existing lines edited 0 y/n, helpers and constants byte-equal y/n, bytes outside the two 0 y/n, skips 0 y/n, non-ASCII added 0 y/n, every added line accounted y/n> · cases <4